---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, '');
---

<Layout title="BeyondProxy 深度评测 - GlobalNet Labs">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <a href={`${base}/proxy`} onclick="history.back();return false;" class="text-sm text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-6">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
        返回代理列表
      </a>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-20 h-20 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-white rounded-xl">
          <img src={`${base}/images/beyondproxy.webp`} alt="BeyondProxy" class="max-w-[80%] max-h-[80%] w-auto h-auto object-contain" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-100">BeyondProxy 评测</h1>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30">7.0</span>
            <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/30">住宅代理</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-400 mt-1">9000万+ 住宅 IP · 150+ 国家 · 住宅+DC+ISP · Sticky IP</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">核心摘要</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">代理类型</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">住宅 + 数据中心 + ISP 代理</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">IP 规模</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">9000 万+ 住宅 IP，150+ 国家</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">核心特性</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">轮换 Sticky IP · 平均延迟 <15ms · 0% 失败率</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-slate-500">可靠性</span>
            <p class="text-slate-200 font-medium mt-1">99.9% 在线率 · 24/7 IP 可用</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">品牌与平台概述</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          BeyondProxy 是一家提供住宅、数据中心和 ISP 三类代理的综合代理服务商，拥有超过 9000 万住宅 IP 资源，覆盖 150+ 国家。其住宅代理网络平均延迟低于 15ms，0% 失败率，支持 Sticky IP 轮换会话。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          数据中心代理和 ISP 代理覆盖 35+ 国家，不限带宽。采用道德 IP 采集方式，提供实时使用统计和 API 管理接口，适合数据采集、广告验证、SEO 监测等场景。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-emerald-500/30 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/20">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z"/></svg>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">方案与类型</h2>
          <span class="text-xs text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30">三类型可选</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-200">住宅代理 · 150+ 国家 · 9000万+ IP</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-200">数据中心代理 · 35+ 国家 · 不限带宽</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2.5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-200">ISP 代理 · 35+ 国家 · 不限带宽</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">Sticky IP 轮换</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">实时统计</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 border border-slate-700/50">
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-300">API 管理</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">平台特性</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-sm">
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">超大 IP 池</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">9000 万+ 住宅 IP 覆盖 150+ 国家，24/7 可用，0% 失败率，确保数据采集不中断。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">极低延迟</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">住宅代理网络平均延迟低于 15ms，采用优化路由策略，适合实时数据抓取。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">三合一代理</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">住宅、数据中心、ISP 三种代理类型一站式提供，按需选择速度与匿名性的最佳平衡。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-xl p-5 border border-slate-700/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-2">Sticky IP 会话</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">住宅代理支持 Sticky IP 轮换会话，可控制会话时长，满足登录态维持等需求。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">优势与局限</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>优势
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>9000 万+ 超大 IP 池，覆盖广泛</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>平均延迟 <15ms，速度优秀</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>住宅+DC+ISP 三合一灵活选择</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>99.9% 在线率，0% 失败率</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>注意事项
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>品牌较新，市场知名度有限</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>价格参照物较少</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>无免费试用信息</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">总结评价</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          BeyondProxy 以 9000 万+ 住宅 IP 和极低延迟为亮点，三合一代理类型覆盖了从高匿名采集到高速抓取的各类场景。Sticky IP 轮换和 0% 失败率确保任务稳定执行。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          不足在于品牌认知度较低，信息透明度有待提高。综合评估，BeyondProxy 获得 7.0 分评价。
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="https://beyondproxy.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-semibold rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 text-lg">
          访问 BeyondProxy
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
